const t = {
  en: {
    heading: "TRUSTED BY MY CLIENTS",
    intro: "Feedback from my clients",
    review1Text: "Trust Billy! He created my website from start to finish, as well as my blog, in September 2025. He is extremely professional, detail-oriented, and very pleasant to work with. By choosing him, you’re choosing excellent value for money. He speaks French very fluently, makes strong and relevant suggestions throughout the entire project process — and even afterwards. He always takes every request into account. I truly recommend him without hesitation.",
    review2PhotoAlt: "Portrait of Aaron and Izia the owners of Pacific Coast Cafe",
    review2Text1: "We hired Billy to create our online store, which is linked to our website, as well as for maintenance and SEO work, and we are absolutely delighted with the result!",
    review2Text2: "Billy is very attentive, responsive, always available, and incredibly kind. Highly professional, he doesn't just execute tasks: he advises, proposes relevant solutions, and even takes the time to do research for us. Thanks to him, we had a clear vision of the actions to take throughout the entire process (with organized lists on Notion), which made the process very smooth.",
    review2Text3: "His support goes far beyond simple technical services: he is a true partner we can trust. We wholeheartedly recommend him. A huge thank you for this excellent work, Billy!",
    review3PhotoAlt: "Portrait of Matt and Jenny the owners of Monkey Mood restaurant, billy nightingale web design client",
    review3Text1: "A huge thank you to Billy for creating our fantastic website. He designed and built a bespoke WordPress site that perfectly meets our needs. If you're looking for a professional website with online booking functionality and multiple pages for your business, we highly recommend working with Billy.",
    review3Text2: "His strong understanding of the local Capbreton and Hossegor market was invaluable in helping us identify our requirements and shape the project. Throughout the process, his attention to detail, professionalism, and communication were exceptional.",
